    Bug 1945765 - Always fire `MRMTimeChanged` and `MRUTimeChanged` folder events when values change. r=aleca

    We have MRMTimeChanged and MRUTimeChanged folder events, but we do not
    trigger the notification in all cases where these values are updated.

    This became apparent through WebExtension APIs. They can listen for
    change events and it was observed that the event is missing for multiple
    cases.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D236683

